- **PRD status:** completed (true)
- **Latest cost record:** attempt 6, started 2026-07-30T19:10:04Z
- **Elapsed:** 0.63 min vs forecast 5.06 min — **under forecast**
- **Cost:** $0.0857 vs forecast $0.1561 — **under forecast**
- **Agent:** typescript-engineer (appropriate for TypeScript/Next.js/Contentstack)
